     <td><para unique="1046459">AVX512F </para>
      <para unique="1046460">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+342106"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046462">Get normalized mantissa from float32 vector zmm2/m512/m32bcst and store the result in zmm1, using imm8 for sign control and mantissa interval normalization, under writemask.</para>
      </td>
